 * The retention sweep. Soft-deleted issues are kept for as long as the plan
 * promises and no longer: the cut-off comes from `retentionDays`, so an
 * enterprise tenant keeps years of history where a free one keeps a month.
 *
 * Every expired issue in the workspace is deleted, along with its label
 * links, comments and attachments. Search documents for the issue and its
 * comments go with it, and the storage counter gives back the megabytes those
 * attachments were charged. Issue numbers are not reused. The audit-log purge
 * past the same cut-off is unchanged. Archived issues are already out of the
